OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Furged people living nearby to keep
OL,8,Fwindows shut and avoid the A162 and Old
OL,9,FGreat North Road, which were closed by
OL,10,Fpolice.
